# Byte-exact artifact contracts must survive checkout unchanged.
#
# `public-data/objects/**` files are named by the sha256 of their own bytes and
# are re-verified in the browser (src/ui/pages/masters.js) and by
# scripts/ci-masters-contract-check.mjs. `core.autocrlf=true` rewrote them to
# CRLF on Windows, which broke both the gate and the page (P1074). `-text`
# disables every line-ending and encoding conversion for these paths.
#
# The broader `* text=auto eol=lf` normalization is intentionally NOT applied
# here: it rewrites the working tree of every tracked text file and must land as
# its own reviewed renormalization commit rather than ride along with a fix.
public-data/objects/** -text

# Binary artifacts that must never be normalized either.
*.png binary
